cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "UCall: Simple Secure Web Client and Server Framework"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0-rc.1
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.7951496
repository-code: https://github.com/unum-cloud/UCall
url: https://github.com/unum-cloud/UCall
abstract: >-
  UCall is a performance-oriented, portable, and compact HTTP framework built around Noise,
  io_uring, and SIMD. Application handlers stay synchronous while caller-owned polling drives
  connection state machines that overlap network I/O and retain request batches, with HTTP and Noise
  clients and servers on capability-specialized I/O backends, exposed through a C ABI with C++,
  Python, and Rust bindings.

authors:
